{% comment %}
  Shop Forge — HP1 Section 11: High-Converting Accordion FAQ
{% endcomment %}

<div class="sf-hp1-faq-section">
  <div class="sf-hp1-container">
    <div class="sf-hp1-section-header">
      <span class="sf-hp1-section-tag">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>
      <h2>Got Questions? We Have Answers</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="sf-hp1-faq-list">
      <details class="sf-hp1-faq-item">
        <summary class="sf-hp1-faq-question">How fast will my order arrive?</summary>
        <div class="sf-hp1-faq-answer">
          All orders are dispatched within 24 hours. Metro cities receive deliveries in 2-3 business days, while other locations take 3-5 days.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="sf-hp1-faq-item">
        <summary class="sf-hp1-faq-question">Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available?</summary>
        <div class="sf-hp1-faq-answer">
          Yes! We offer Cash on Delivery across 26,000+ pincodes in India with zero hidden charges.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="sf-hp1-faq-item">
        <summary class="sf-hp1-faq-question">What is your replacement policy?</summary>
        <div class="sf-hp1-faq-answer">
          We offer a 7-day hassle-free doorstep replacement policy if your product is defective or damaged during transit.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sf-hp1-faq-section {
    background: #0f172a;
    padding: 70px 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .sf-hp1-faq-list {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .sf-hp1-faq-item {
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .sf-hp1-faq-question {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }
  .sf-hp1-faq-answer {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "HP1: FAQ Accordion",
  "target": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
